Package: irw
Type: Package
Title: Access and Analyze Data from the Item Response Warehouse
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Hansol", "Lee", email = "hansol@stanford.edu", role = c("aut")),
	person("Michael", "Hardy", email = "hardym@stanford.edu",role = c("aut")),
	person("Ben", "Domingue", email = "ben.domingue@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
	)
Maintainer: Ben Domingue <ben.domingue@gmail.com>
URL: https://itemresponsewarehouse.github.io/Rpkg/
Contact: mailto:itemresponsewarehouse@stanford.edu
Description: Tools for finding, downloading, and analyzing datasets from the
    Item Response Warehouse, a harmonized collection of item response data
    from educational and psychological measurement described in Nadela et al.
    (2026) <doi:10.59863/cijg4549>. Functions search tables by metadata,
    fetch them in a common long format, reshape between long and wide
    layouts, simulate item response data, and compare the predictive
    accuracy of fitted models with the InterModel Vigorish.
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
